The adb-deployer image installs Alpine's android-tools package, unmodified,
for its target architecture. It retains both the native and libusb USB backends.
Original Android Tools 35.0.2 and bundled-library licenses/notices are retained
in third_party/licenses/android-tools, with source/archive/Alpine patch links
and the verified source checksum in SOURCE.txt. The image also includes these
records at /usr/share/licenses/android-tools. Alpine's installed package database
records the actual package and dependency versions used by each image build.

Builds collect remaining npm and Go module license/notice files without
rewriting their contents. These are included in Release archives and images;
frontend notices are also embedded at /THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.
